# Text files are LF in every checkout, Windows included (core.autocrlf would turn them into CRLF, and the tests read
# the sources as they are kept); Windows scripts keep CRLF (cmd and PowerShell expect it)
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.nsh text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
